    "word": "子",
    "basic_meaning": "古代对男子的尊称，这里指孔子。",
    "follow_up_questions": []
  },
  {
    "text_id": "WEN_14",
    "word": "时习",
    "basic_meaning": "按时温习。时，按时。",
